.env
compose.override.yaml
*.log
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# NOTE: data/ is deliberately NOT ignored. recessions.json is the vendored
# shared dataset the charts shade from, and the jsonl logs are append-only
# records of what upstream actually did. Machine-owned artefacts that are
# rewritten wholesale every run are listed individually instead.
data/*.tmp
# The page payload: ~700KB of spot prices, replaced entirely on each refresh.
data/crack.json
# The econ-core contract view of the same numbers, likewise regenerable.
data/series.json
